        "*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table style=\"background:transparent;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding-right: 1em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hearthstone_(game)\" title=\"Hearthstone (game)\"><img alt=\"Hearthlogo\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/d/d1/Hearthlogo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/100?cb=20171221082913\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Hearthlogo.png\" data-image-key=\"Hearthlogo.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding-right: 1em;\"><div style=\"margin-top: 1ex; padding: 0.3ex 1em; border-top: 1px #808080 solid; border-bottom: 1px #808080 solid;\">\n<p><small><b>This article contains information and lore exclusive to <i><a href=\"/wiki/Hearthstone_(game)\" title=\"Hearthstone (game)\">Hearthstone</a></i>, and is considered <a href=\"/wiki/Canon\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Canon\">non-canon</a>.</b></small>\n</p>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"noexcerpt\" data-nosnippet=\"\"><i>Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/White_Lady\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"White Lady\">White Lady</a>.</i></span></dd></dl>\n<table class=\"infobox darktable\" cellspacing=\"3\" style=\"border-spacing:3px;width:22em;width:21.5em;\"><tbody><tr class=\"above-header\"><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:125%;font-weight:bold;padding:5px;\"><span style=\"display:table;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;\"><span style=\"display:table-row;\"><span style=\"display:table-cell;vertical-align:middle;padding-right:5px;width:1px;\"><span class=\"\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Faction\" title=\"Neutral\"><img alt=\"Neutral\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/1/19/Neutral_32.png/revision/latest?cb=20110620212507\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"18\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Neutral 32.png\" data-image-key=\"Neutral_32.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span></span></span><span style=\"display:table-cell;vertical-align:middle;padding-right:2px;\">Lady in White</span></span></span></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/8/84/Lady_in_White.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20180331090225\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Image of Lady in White\"><img alt=\"Image of Lady in White\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"267\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Lady in White.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Lady_in_White.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/8/84/Lady_in_White.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/200?cb=20180331090225\" /></a></span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Gender</th><td>\nFemale</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Race</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Ghost\" title=\"Ghost\">Ghost</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Location</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Blackwald\" title=\"Blackwald\">Witchwood</a></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt\" style=\"margin: calc(0.5em + 1vh) auto calc(0.5em + 1vh) min(24px, calc(15px + 1.25%)); max-width:calc(70% + 15em)\">\n<div style=\"font-style:italic\">\n<p>“She was a lady in polka dots until the gnomish laundromat incident.”\n</p>\n</div>\n<dl><dd>— Flavor text</dd></dl></div>\n<p>The <b>Lady in White</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Ghost\" title=\"Ghost\">ghostly</a> being featured in the <i><a href=\"/wiki/Hearthstone:_The_Witchwood\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hearthstone: The Witchwood\">The Witchwood</a></i> expansion for <i><a href=\"/wiki/Hearthstone_(game)\" title=\"Hearthstone (game)\">Hearthstone</a></i>. <a href=\"/wiki/Gilneas_City\" title=\"Gilneas City\">Gilneas</a> is a haunted city. Many of its ghosts are here to help. In life, the Lady in White was a Gilnean noble woman, who saw the destruction of almost all that she loved during the fall of Gilneas. As a ghost, she seeks to help the living restore all that was lost.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> While the activity of restless spirits has increased sharply since the arrival of the curse in the Witchwood, most seem to be petty, malignant things, content to rage against the living. Not so with the Lady in White, who has become a symbol of hope and reassurance to the citizens of Gilneas in this dark time. She tends to appear only to those in deepest despair, and to each witness, she resembles a mother, sister, wife, or friend come to offer comfort from beyond the veil. Her dress is always white, though this detail differs as well; some insist that she was wearing her wedding dress, while others say it was a noblewoman's gown or that she was a poor girl in a plain white shift. Regardless, one consistent element among reports is that the Lady in White's expression is kind, yet achingly sad, and that she seems to be searching for something. Most will never witness the Lady in White, but those who have who have received her blessing have seen their spirits lifted in a most profound way.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quotes\">Quotes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<dl><dt>Summon</dt>\n<dd>What was lost can be found again.</dd></dl>\n<dl><dt>Attack</dt>\n<dd>Hush now.</dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"reflist\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal;font-size:calc(80% + 2.1px);\"><div style=\"margin-top:-0.3em; margin-bottom:0px; height:0px\">&#160;</div><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">^</a> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a target=\"_self\" rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://twitter.com/hwoome/status/983413744838459392\">He-Rim Woo on Twitter</a>&#32;(2018-04-09).&#8203; “Lady in White:  Gilneas is a haunted city.  Many of its ghosts are here to help!  In life, she was a Gilnean noble woman, who saw the destruction of almost all that she loved during the fall of Gilneas.  As a ghost, she seeks to help the living restore all that was lost.”</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-2\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-2\">^</a> <span class=\"reference-text\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blizzard_Entertainment\" title=\"Blizzard Entertainment\"><img alt=\"Blizzard Entertainment\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/2/20/Blizz.gif/revision/latest?cb=20171007185539\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Blizz.gif\" data-image-key=\"Blizz.gif\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Daxxarri\" title=\"Daxxarri\">Daxxarri</a>&#32;2018-04-25.&#32;<a target=\"_self\" rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://playhearthstone.com/en-us/blog/21694425/\">The Witchwood – Mysterious Missives Part 3</a>.&#32;Retrieved on 2018-04-25.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hearthstone_(game)\" title=\"Hearthstone\"><img alt=\"Hearthstone\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon-Hearthstone-22x22.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon-Hearthstone-22x22.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/1/14/Icon-Hearthstone-22x22.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/22?cb=20180708194307\" /></a></span> <a href=\"https://hearthstone.fandom.com/wiki/Lady_in_White\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"hswiki:Lady in White\">On the Hearthstone Wiki</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261108222218\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.076 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.096 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1595/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 7626/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2298/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 11/100\nExpensive parser function count: 1/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1661/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.007/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 646034/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   70.381      1 -total\n 60.78%   42.775      1 Template:Npcbox\n 55.45%   39.023      1 Template:Infobox\n 20.80%   14.640      1 Template:Reflist\n 16.62%   11.694      1 Template:Level\n  7.33%    5.161      2 Template:Ref_web\n  5.93%    4.177      1 Template:Tw\n  5.33%    3.750      1 Template:Hearth\n  3.83%    2.695      1 Template:FactionIcon\n  2.79%    1.964      1 Template:Hearthstone\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.10_prod_wowpedia:pcache